      "text": "```python\nimport re\n\n_ATTR = r'(?:[^>\"\\']|\"[^\"]*\"|\\'[^\\']*\\')*'\n_SCRIPT_BLOCK = re.compile(\n    r'<script\\b' + _ATTR + r'>.*?</script\\s*>',\n    re.IGNORECASE | re.DOTALL,\n)\n_SCRIPT_UNCLOSED_OPEN = re.compile(\n    r'<script\\b' + _ATTR + r'>.*\\Z',\n    re.IGNORECASE | re.DOTALL,\n)\n_SCRIPT_STRAY_TAG = re.compile(\n    r'</?script\\b' + _ATTR + r'>',\n    re.IGNORECASE,\n)\n\n\ndef filter_script_tags(content: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Remove <script> tags from the content argument and return the result.\"\"\"\n    previous = None\n    result = content\n    # Repeat until stable so that obfuscated input such as \"<scr<script></script>ipt>\"\n    # cannot reassemble a script tag after a removal.\n    while result != previous:\n        previous = result\n        result = _SCRIPT_BLOCK.sub('', result)\n        result = _SCRIPT_UNCLOSED_OPEN.sub('', result)\n        result = _SCRIPT_STRAY_TAG.sub('', result)\n    return result\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
